WEBVTT

00:00:03.257 --> 00:00:07.140
The Content Items menu entry opens the Manage Content page.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.231
Let's edit the About article.

00:00:09.231 --> 00:00:13.473
Further down, the WidgetsList section shows a card for each zone:

00:00:13.473 --> 00:00:14.967
Content and Footer.

00:00:15.417 --> 00:00:19.905
In the Footer zone, the plus button titled Add Widget opens a list.

00:00:19.905 --> 00:00:24.637
It holds every content type with the Widget stereotype, sorted by name.

00:00:25.101 --> 00:00:26.664
Let's choose Paragraph.

00:00:26.664 --> 00:00:29.252
A card for the widget appears in the zone.

00:00:29.252 --> 00:00:33.241
Expand it, and write the text that visitors will read in the footer.

00:00:33.729 --> 00:00:37.071
Let's add a Blockquote to the Content zone the same way.

00:00:37.071 --> 00:00:39.389
Its only field is Quote, a text area.

00:00:42.228 --> 00:00:46.254
Let's choose Publish, which saves the widgets together with the article.

00:00:46.254 --> 00:00:50.848
The widgets are stored in the article itself, so they belong to this article alone.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:55.050
On the About page, the quote is shown in the Content zone, and

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.200
the paragraph in the Footer zone.

